l human facial appearance of that image. Remain human, planted, breathing and surrounded by turbulent golden energy through 6.58 seconds. No new figure or text.\n\noverall_soundscape: Quiet wind and heavy breathing initially. A low energy rumble builds with gravel rattle. From 2.3 to 4.7 seconds, one powerful raw ADULT MALE NONVERBAL EXERTION YELL synchronized to the open mouth. No words, no impersonation. Golden ki produces an expanding low pressure rush and moving stones. After 4.7 seconds, the yell releases into breath and the energy becomes a softer turbulent hum. No music or melody.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: None.",
